Apply Week 5 concepts on email security
Scenario: You are securing an internal company message.
Tasks:
1. Generate key pairs using GPG or OpenSSL for PGP/S/MIME
2. Sign and encrypt a text file as "Alice"
3. Verify and decrypt it as "Bob"
Deliverables:
● original_message.txt, signed_message.asc, decrypted_message.txt
● public.asc, private.key
● signature_verification.txt explaining how the signature validates the sender
